  "description": "Create a morning-menu announcement from a real cafe photo.",
  "instruction": "Create an 800x600 morning-menu image from the coffee street photo. Crop tightly around the storefront, brighten the photo, add a cream card in the upper left, add the title NEW MORNING MENU, and add the detail ESPRESSO + PASTRY COMBO.",
